  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Area of Historical Memory at the UCA&apos;s Institute of Human Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed at strengthening the recently created Area of Historical Memory at UCA&apos;s Human Rights Institute (IDHUCA). UCA is committed to preserving historical memory in El Salvador, as well as to the application of restorative justice. As a consequence, UCA decided to create this new area of work within the IDHUCA that will coordinate all work related to the promotion of historical memory.</narrative>
  </description>
